  "decision_conditions": [
    "1.      The flats hereby permitted shall be\nused for Class C3 dwellinghouse(s) only and notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General\nPermitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any Order revoking or\nre-enacting that Order with or without modification), no development within\nSchedule 2, Part 3, Class L shall take place.",
    "Within\none month following the date of this planning permission, the cycle racks and\nbin stores shall be installed in accordance with the approved details and retained\nin perpetuity.",
    "The refuse bins shall be stored at all times, other than on collection days, in the designated refuse storage area, as shown on the approved drawing.",
    "Within\nthree months of the date of this permission,  Emergency Planning\nInformation shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning\nAuthority, to ensure evacuation arrangements are adequate and safe\naccess/egress from the site during a flood event is provided. Details of safe\naccess/egress arrangements and a plan indicating a safe route for the occupants\nand users away from the source of flooding\nshould be submitted. The Emergency Planning Information shall include the surface water flood extent, depth, velocity and\nhazard maps plus the fluvial flood extent map and fluvial flood levels. The applicant should refer to LB Harrow SFRA,\nEmergency Flood Plan, NPPF and reference should be made to EA flood warning\nprocedures for occupants and users.",
    "1.     \nDetails of the SBD Measures as outlined in the\nemail dated the 9th June 2025, shall be submitted for the approval of\nthe Local Planning Authority within three months of the date of this planning permission.\nThe approved SBD Measures shall be installed within two months of the approval\nof such details by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be retained in accordance with the following approved plans and documents: A105 Rev:A; A106\nRev:A; A107 Rev:A; A113 Rev:A; A114 Rev:A; A115 Rev:A; A116 Rev:A; A117\nRev:A; B01 Rev:A; A104 Rev:B; A118 Rev:B; A119 Rev:B; A120 Rev:B; A121 Rev:;\nEmail dated 9th June 2025; Bellus Quad Wheelie Bin Storage Chest\nDetails; Wheelie Bin Store 149 (2 Bins) Details; Wall Mounted Cycle Stand\nDetails (1m); Building Control Completion Certificates."
  ],
